      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout fixed-width\" data-layout=\"fixed-width\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h1 id=\"OdooPurchaseConfiguration-PriceMarkup\">Price Markup </h1><p>Bahmni provides a customized module for Odoo, through which you can define markup percentages to be applied over a product's cost price to be determined as unit price. </p><p>To define the ranges and applicable markups, you need to do the following:</p><ul><li><p>Navigate to Menu → Bahmni → Bahmni Masters → Sale Price Markup Rule</p></li><li><p>Define the ranges of Cost Price and the percentage that needs to be applied for that range.<br/></p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" alt=\"image-20240812-173523.png\" width=\"1305\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900497457/image-20240812-173523.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723484128403&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1305&amp;height=270\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/900497457/image-20240812-173523.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723484128403&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-height=\"371\" data-width=\"1791\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3690528775\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image-20240812-173523.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"900497457\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"8\" data-media-id=\"e05ba9d6-a4dd-4452-be2f-21fce689f5fe\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900497457/image-20240812-173523.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723484128403&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=2610&amp;height=540 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900497457/image-20240812-173523.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723484128403&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1305&amp;height=270 1x\"></span><p> </p></li></ul><div class=\"expand-container conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"9f58fcd1-11e4-429f-b24b-2ca021885302\" data-macro-name=\"expand\" id=\"expander-672500829\"><div id=\"expander-control-672500829\" class=\"expand-control\"><span class=\"expand-control-icon icon\"> </span><span class=\"expand-control-text\">Odoo 10 Markup Configuration</span></div><div id=\"expander-content-672500829\" class=\"expand-content expand-hidden\"><ul><li><p>Go to &quot;Menu / Purchases / Configuration / Price Markup Table&quot;</p></li><li><p>Define ranges of price, and applicable markup percentages for each range</p></li></ul><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"656\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900497457/Odoo_Price_Markup_Table_Ranges.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565365906556&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=656&amp;height=195\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/900497457/Odoo_Price_Markup_Table_Ranges.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565365906556&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-height=\"488\" data-width=\"1638\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"904364141\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Odoo_Price_Markup_Table_Ranges.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"900497457\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"8\" data-media-id=\"58435f77-a491-40a7-a044-689374010c19\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900497457/Odoo_Price_Markup_Table_Ranges.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565365906556&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1312&amp;height=390 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900497457/Odoo_Price_Markup_Table_Ranges.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565365906556&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=656&amp;height=195 1x\" /></span></div></div><p /><p>Now when you receive a product, and if the product was configured for <strong>“Tracking By Lots”, </strong>then you will find that Sales price will be calculated based on the above configuration.</p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-equal\" data-layout=\"two-equal\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-left-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-left\" alt=\"image-20240812-173908.png\" width=\"640\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900497457/image-20240812-173908.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723484352971&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=640&amp;height=303\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/900497457/image-20240812-173908.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723484352971&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-height=\"465\" data-width=\"982\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3690692656\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image-20240812-173908.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"900497457\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"8\" data-media-id=\"e92e196d-6c56-4d0c-a019-594c47e45c59\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900497457/image-20240812-173908.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723484352971&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1280&amp;height=606 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900497457/image-20240812-173908.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723484352971&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=640&amp;height=303 1x\"></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"612\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900497457/Odoo_receive_product_lots_with_markup.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565599174605&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=612&amp;height=284\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/900497457/Odoo_receive_product_lots_with_markup.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565599174605&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-height=\"1042\" data-width=\"2244\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"904168184\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Odoo_receive_product_lots_with_markup.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"900497457\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"8\" data-media-id=\"0a8f404a-e36c-4300-9cdb-7f835b144b4c\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900497457/Odoo_receive_product_lots_with_markup.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565599174605&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1224&amp;height=568 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900497457/Odoo_receive_product_lots_with_markup.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565599174605&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=612&amp;height=284 1x\"></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"columnLayout fixed-width\" data-layout=\"fixed-width\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<p>In the above screenshot, the &quot;Sale Price&quot; is calculated based on the markup percentage defined over &quot;Cost Price&quot; (in this case 10%)</p><p /><h3 id=\"OdooPurchaseConfiguration-EnableusingthemarkuppriceasUnitPriceinSaleQuotations\">Enable using the markup price as Unit Price in Sale Quotations</h3><p><strong>NOTE: </strong>Setting up the markup percentages and receiving the products, does not mean that the lots/Serial based costs calculated through markups will apply by default.</p><ul><li><p>Navigate to <code>Menu -&gt; Settings -&gt; Bahmni</code></p></li><li><p>Under Sale Configurations, toggle the <strong>Sale Price Markup Rule</strong> option to use the markup price as Unit price for Sale Quotations.<br/></p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" alt=\"image-20240812-174418.png\" width=\"1305\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900497457/image-20240812-174418.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723484662262&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1305&amp;height=147\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/900497457/image-20240812-174418.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723484662262&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-height=\"203\" data-width=\"1791\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3690528782\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image-20240812-174418.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"900497457\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"8\" data-media-id=\"d8a583ce-afae-407f-8351-51012fd2f8a9\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900497457/image-20240812-174418.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723484662262&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=2610&amp;height=294 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900497457/image-20240812-174418.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723484662262&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1305&amp;height=147 1x\"></span><p /></li><li><p>Note: Enabling this feature will restrict the rules of pricelist being applied on that specific order line item. </p></li></ul><div class=\"expand-container conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"854b5cf7-1b9d-4cd8-ac3e-2959efc2936f\" data-macro-name=\"expand\" id=\"expander-1865653832\"><div id=\"expander-control-1865653832\" class=\"expand-control\"><span class=\"expand-control-icon icon\"> </span><span class=\"expand-control-text\">Odoo 10</span></div><div id=\"expander-content-1865653832\" class=\"expand-content expand-hidden\"><p> If you want the “sale price” of the Lots/Serial to reflect on “Sale order”, you will need to enable <strong>“Determine sale price based on cost price markup”</strong> option under “Menu / Sales / Configuration / Settings / Markup”. </p><p> </p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" alt=\"image-20240812-174312.png\" width=\"1156\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900497457/image-20240812-174312.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723484596218&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1156&amp;height=301\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/900497457/image-20240812-174312.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723484596218&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-height=\"301\" data-width=\"1156\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3690070047\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image-20240812-174312.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"900497457\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"8\" data-media-id=\"33cd8374-5f0a-4821-950c-07a70164e09d\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900497457/image-20240812-174312.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723484596218&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=2312&amp;height=602 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/900497457/image-20240812-174312.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1723484596218&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1156&amp;height=301 1x\" /></span><p> </p></div></div><p /><p /></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
